Well, some kind soul directed me to the comp.sources.games archives.
I have managed to get a working nethack2.3 on our system, for which
I am grateful.

As to recent discussions: I still feel that Elbereth should protect
you from dragon breath and missile weapons, etc, but that the wand or
spell use from Elbereth should be removed. Generally, it does well
as a total truce. 

Hand of Elbereth: A while ago, someone suggested the possibility of
the gods getting *really* mad and crowning you 'Rectum of Elbereth.'
This has been implemented on our version. Not very likely, but it
can happen. Then they set your hp and ep to 1 each. Maximums too.
I have yet to see anyone win from here

Excalibur: well, our version wouldn't let you name a long sword
excalibur. It will also now not let you name a katana Snickersnee,
or a t-h sword Orcrist, or a dagger/short sword Sting. However, the
lady of the lake will change your weapon as appropriate. Also, the
gods will do this to your weapon in hand when you become HoE.

If anyone would like this source code, email me about it, and I can
send it to you. I would warn you, though, that most of the options
are now encoded for real, i.e. almost no #ifdefs left. I figure it's
much easier to edit this way. Whatever.

